<%- include('components/header') %>

<h1 class="subject">We received your feedback!</h1>

<%- include('components/greetings', { name }) %>

<p>
  Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback with us. We've received your
  <strong><%= type %></strong> submission and wanted to let you know that we're on it.
</p>

<blockquote class="message-preview">
  “<%= message %>…”
</blockquote>

<p>
  Our team reviews every piece of feedback carefully. We're constantly working to improve
  Memento, and your input helps us build a better product for everyone.
</p>

<p><strong>What happens next?</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Our team will review your feedback within 48 hours</li>
  <li>If we need more information, we'll reach out to you at <%= email %></li>
  <li>We'll keep you updated on any progress related to your feedback</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Have more thoughts to share? Feel free to send us more feedback anytime.
</p>

<p>Thanks again for helping us improve Memento!</p>

<%- include('components/closing-text') %>
<%- include('components/footer') %>
